    "field": "The effect of climate change on precipitation extremes",
    "problem": "This paper addresses the challenge of predicting precipitation extreme intensification with warming, which is hindered by an incomplete understanding of dynamical and microphysical contributions and the inability of climate models to resolve key convective processes.",
    "method": "This review paper proposes analyzing the response of precipitation extremes to climate change by integrating results from theory, modeling, and observations to understand the underlying physical factors, including thermodynamic, dynamical, and microphysical contributions.",
    "task": "The task is to review the response of precipitation extremes to climate change by synthesizing results from theory, modeling, and observations, with a focus on the physical factors that control the response.",
